ence/C45/activation-20261102-g11/p09-source/AGENTS.md\ndocs/planning/evidence/C45/activation-20261102-g11/p09-source/docs/architecture/ui-v2/screens/administration-inventory.md\ndocs/planning/evidence/C45/activation-20261102-g11/p09-source/docs/architecture/notice-inventory.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/C45/activation-20261102-g11/p09-source/docs/planning/C45-draft.md\ndocs/planning/evidence/C45/activation-20261102-g11/p09-source/crates/desktop-core/src/admin_inventory.rs\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
