packet.py\ntools/p09/make-phase-packet-c32-production.py\ntools/p09/test_p09_workbench_policy.py\ntools/p09/audit-phase-review-owner-closure.py\ntools/p09/seal-c31-transition.py\ntools/p09/test_c31_owner_completion.py\ntools/p09/c32_transition_policy.py\ntools/p09/phase_packet_p09_workbench.py\ntools/p09/audit-p09-checks-c31-transition.py\ntools/p09/phase_inputs_c32_transition.py\n# C45 / P10 explicit future verification\n\nP09 remains an immutable historical prerequisite. Its full source and originally\nignored evidence are archived under C45 activation; no old inventory or verdict\nis edited. C30/C41 owner standing remains distinct from independent scores.\n\n`seal.py` derives all current mapped native IDs plus C45's identity assertions\nand the approved 16 selected repository commands. `c45_baseline` uses the existing\nRust Runner, Manifest and Environment; it retains raw RunRecords and excludes\nsetup already performed offline, duplicate frontend execution and the two real\nlogin-Keychain/search-list probes. P10 selects C45 rather than replaying retired\nC01-C44 commands. Production FileStore/authority and disposable-file Keychain\nregressions replace old import/adoption and private-Keychain probes explicitly.\n\n`supervise.py` requires guest Terminal ancestry, a global UI-writer flock, sealed\nsource, exact fixture/bundle bindings and foreground checks. Every stage keeps\nraw stdout/stderr and the original runner/native records. It stops on failure\nand preserves completed stages. Partial stages require explicit ownership and\nraw-result diagnosis; model/tool exit does not terminate this Terminal-owned job.\n`native.py` only relocates existing driver evidence paths and uses their original\nassertions. `acceptance_c45.py --smoke` is a short current identity preflight,\nnever cumulative acceptance. The real C45 rows also require separate qualified\nproduction-interface and mapped coverage; UI absence is not non-adoption proof.\n\n`finalize.py` binds actual executions. `qualification.py` verifies complete ID\nmembership, approved command/cwd, original RunRecord/native results, input/log\nhashes and per-driver evidence. Exact reuse requires executable, complete bundle,\nrelevant helper closure, flags and conditions. Changed test/lint targets must\nexecute. Unaffected carry retains original artifacts and requires actual unchanged\ndependency-file proofs. No assertion retirement can be introduced by omission.\nP10 consumes the same qualified candidate without claiming new execution.\n\n`packet.py make|audit C45|P10 attempt-NN` uses a fresh read-only configured Codex\nreview through the retained launcher. Audits never assign scores. C45 can be\naccepted at 8 under D034, then needs actual full9 before P10; P10 needs actual\nfull9 with empty fixes/blockers/gaps. C26/P08 remains open/manual fallback.\n\nBoth release-candidate packaging and the actual production build entrypoint\nrequire C01-C25 plus genuine audited P09/P10 proof, including C45 full9 member and\nqualified coverage. C26 is not a circular prerequisite of its own release build.\nThis work authorizes no live product calls, user credential/data discovery,\npublication, signing, notarization or installation.\n{\n  \"command_without_prompt\": [\n    \"codex\",\n    \"--no-daemon\",\n    \"-a\",\n    \"never\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"hooks\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"plugins\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"apps\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"remote_plugin\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"browser_use\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"browser_use_external\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"in_app_browser\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"computer_use\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"image_generation\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"multi_agent\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"skill_search\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"skill_mcp_dependency_install\",\n    \"--disable\",\n    \"unbounded_connection_retries\",\n    \"exec\",\n    \"-s\",\n    \"read-only\",\n    \"--skip-git-repo-check\",\n    \"--ephemeral\",\n    \"--ignore-user-config\",\n    \"--ignore-rules\",\n    \"-m\",\n    \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"--json\",\n    \"--color\",\n    \"never\",\n    \"-c\",\n    \"web_search=\\\"disabled\\\"\",\n    \"-c\",\n    \"model_reasoning_effort=\\\"xhigh\\\"\",\n    \"--output-schema\",\n    \"docs/architecture/review-verdict.schema.json\",\n    \"-o\",\n    \"/Users/cdot/development/redtail/prisma-airs-desktop-v2-current/.work/c45-p10-20261102/docs/planning/reviews/C45/attempt-01/verdict-returned.json\"\n  ],\n  \"model_requested\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n  \"harness_version_observed\": \"codex-cli 0.166.0\",\n  \"request_sha256\": \"dd5ee77d0646e354b09e4d5a15caa89deb75e42744bfda44b516f25687fc1b1d\",\n  \"schema_sha256\": \"7f6beeb0e4788e739789ac980cc8803d8583f3f8c45e13d4f9f7e69c7a353b6e\",\n  \"feature_probe_sha256\": \"bb4d01d583993c8e3c431e0437092e6c288e9b5da919595063853d37e2d89862\",\n  \"restricted_features_observed\": {\n    \"hooks\": \"false\",\n    \"plugins\": \"false\",\n    \"apps\": \"false\",\n    \"remote_plugin\": \"false\",\n    \"browser_use\": \"false\",\n    \"browser_use_external\": \"false\",\n    \"in_app_browser\": \"false\",\n    \"computer_use\": \"false\",\n    \"image_generation\": \"false\",\n    \"multi_agent\": \"false\",\n    \"skill_search\": \"false\",\n    \"skill_mcp_dependency_install\": \"false\",\n    \"unbounded_connection_retries\": \"false\"\n  },\n  \"limits\": \"CLI arguments and feature probe establish requested isolation; inspect actual run events and reviewer limitations. No provider/model authorship or review pass is inferred.\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
